    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Elyse Hoffenberg is an attorney and former Cook County prosecutor who serves as Clerk of Lyons Township. She is president of the Lyons Township Mental Health Commission, and she previously chaired the La Grange Police and Fire Commission and served on the La Grange District 105 school board. Her campaign website lists priorities of efficient government, safe communities, and a sustainable Cook County. Her campaign says she has launched programs at the Lyons Township Mental Health Commission aimed at supporting seniors and youth. As township clerk, she announced the launch of Dolly Parton’s Imagination Library in Lyons Township, a program that provides one free book per month to children for the first five years of their lives.",
